Conflict resolution: guest_form_admin.html banner: PR 230's main has no hand-filing yet in this order (WP23 comes later), so the banner keeps main's sent/submitted_at title and only gains WP25's id="filed-lock-note"; WP23 adds its filed-by-hand title in its own step. reporting.py: the small _field() helper that guest_is_filed() uses came from WP23 on golive; it is defined here now. tests/test_wp25_reported_bugs.py: the hand-filed variants (manual_filed_at) move to the WP23 step; here the filed guest covers the lock, and the stay-page test declares one guest. Cross-WP text: with filed guests locked, the moved-after-report notice (notification.reason.moved_after_report) and the guide's date-change paragraph now send the host to the UbyPort web application for a correction instead of "resend" (EN, CS; tests/test_notification_copy.py updated). WP25's open point about the VracetPDF order is settled by WP30, which comes earlier in this series.
